# Story page: achievements
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = The Wall of Glory
---
In a dim hallway an old tortoise keeps a wall of shiny badges, and he nails one up for every single thing a snake does, whether or not it was a good idea.

'Even the embarrassing things?' asked {name}. 'Especially those,' said the tortoise, and he smiled the slow smile of someone who has waited three hundred years for exactly that question.
